<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR firms to 13.00pct from 12.85 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR firms to 13.00pct from 12.85 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month rose to 13.00 percent from 12.85 percent on Monday and the bid rate (Athibid) increased to 12.51 percent from 12.36 percent.</p>
